spans.s:
. pl. आ॑नमन्ताम्, RV. vi, 49, 4)
to bend down, bend, bow, incline, R.; BhP.; Ragh. &c.;
to do homage, salute reverently, BhP.; ŚBr. &c.;
to condescend;
to be propitious (as gods to men), RV. vi, 50, 4;
to bring near;
to bend towards or near;
to subdue, RV. :
Caus. -नामयति and -नमयति, to inflect, bend (a bow), cause to bend, subdue, MBh.; Mālav.; Hariv.
